    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "The Singaporean parliament amends the Transboundary Haze Pollution Act of 2014, introducing arrest powers, permitting trials without defendants present,…",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Due to improving haze conditions, the Singapore government announced on 5 November they will close all air-conditioned rooms serving as haze shelters and cease all haze mitigation procedures from 7 November…",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384099676:65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "The 2026 Southeast Asian haze crisis is an air pollution event and the current continuous transboundary haze season that is affecting several countries in Southeast Asia since August 2026, including Brunei, Indonesia…",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384099676:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:24Z",
      "text": "On the map: Singapore, Malaysia, where the reports place it.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:32Z",
